{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2mp12329","type":"work","title":"後漢藝文志","authors":[{"name":"姚振宗","role":"撰","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bhkv","dynasty":"清"}],"description":{"text":"清姚振宗撰，四卷，首冠敘錄。因覽錢大昭《補續漢書藝文志》、侯康《補後漢書藝文志》二書之敚略不完，故别自爲編。人物撰著悉以獻帝遜位之年爲斷，綜四部爲類四十二，附以佛道凡四十四類。光緒己丑（1889）成書。","sources":["敘錄"]},"resources":[{"name":"CText","id":"ctext","url":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&res=137140","types":["image"]},{"name":"CText（適園叢書版）","id":"ctext-shiyuancongshu","url":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&res=182491","types":["image"]},{"name":"识典古籍","id":"shidianguji","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02091104","types":["image"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02091104.cn","types":["image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-commons-xuxiu","name":"維基共享 續修四庫全書 PDF","short_name":"維基共享","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%8C%E4%BF%AE%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E7%AC%AC0914%E5%86%8A.pdf","metadata":{"volume":914},"types":["image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%BE%8C%E6%BC%A2%E8%97%9D%E6%96%87%E5%BF%97%28%E4%B8%80%29.djvu"}],"juan_count":{"number":4,"description":"四卷，首冠敘錄一卷"},"contained_in":[{"id":"8rlcsybg2hhh","volume_index":"第7卷"}],"ai_note":"姚振宗（1842–1906），字海槎，會稽紹興陶家堰人。此書爲後漢書補撰藝文志，屬私修目錄。因錢大昭《補續漢書藝文志》上及西漢下包三國且草率不完，侯康《補後漢書藝文志》未竣之初稿缺集部佛道，故姚氏别自爲編。門類以書之有無爲斷，立經史子集四部四十二類，附以佛道凡四十四類。收入《二十五史藝文經籍志考補萃編》第7卷（清華大學出版社，2011）。","measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":4}],"measure_info":"四卷","indexed_by":[{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《後漢藝文志》四卷","author_info":"清姚振宗撰","summary":"《後漢藝文志》四卷。清姚振宗撰。影印民國五年張氏刻適園叢書本。","edition":"影印民國五年張氏刻適園叢書本","volume":"第914冊","section":"史部 史部"}],"updated_at":"2026-08-23T00:00:00-07:00","_has_image":true,"_has_collated":true,"period":"qing","period_basis":"著錄原文自書撰人朝代：《續修四庫全書》「清姚振宗撰」","revision":"1.0.1","revised_at":"2026-09-07","books":["6z3onzeexh"],"has_collated":true,"has_image":true,"_path":"Work/3/2/9/d